aph 도구" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2b2b2b;" vertex="1" parent="v61"><mxGeometry x="32" y="0" width="164" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v64" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6f4ea;strokeColor=#3a9a5b;container=1;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1" parent="zq"><mxGeometry x="250" y="365" width="200" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v65" value="" style="shape=image;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjM2E5YTViIiBzdHJva2Utd2lkdGg9IjEuOCIgc3Ryb2tlLWxpbmVjYXA9InJvdW5kIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWpvaW49InJvdW5kIj48Y2lyY2xlIGN4PSIxMiIgY3k9IjEyIiByPSI5Ii8+PHBhdGggZD0iTTggMTJsMyAzIDUtNiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==;" vertex="1" parent="v64"><mxGeometry x="8" y="7.0" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v66" value="TestLocator (COVERS)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2b2b2b;" vertex="1" parent="v64"><mxGeometry x="32" y="0" width="164" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v67" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#efe9f8;strokeColor=#7c5cbf;container=1;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1" parent="zq"><mxGeometry x="470" y="365" width="200" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v68" value="" style="shape=image;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="v67"><mxGeometry x="8" y="7.0" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v69" value="ImpactFinder (CALLS)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2b2b2b;" vertex="1" parent="v67"><mxGeometry x="32" y="0" width="164" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v70" value="쓰임: 도구는 에이전트(탐색·진단)가 부른다 · TestLocator는 maintain의 '기존 테스트 상태'(규칙표 입력, 실측만) ·&#xa;ImpactFinder는 영향 범위(화면·지침서·--impact) — 추정이라 규칙표에는 넣지 않는다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#6b7280;" vertex="1" parent="zq"><mxGeometry x="30" y="410" width="640" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v71" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=#6b7280;container=1;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1" parent="zq"><mxGeometry x="30" y="480" width="640" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v72" value="" style="shape=image;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="v71"><mxGeometry x="8" y="7.0" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v73" value="그래프에 있으면 사실이다 — 확정 엣지만 조치 결정에 쓰고, 추정(CALLS)은 표기와 함께 참고로만" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2b2b2b;" vertex="1" parent="v71"><mxGeometry x="32" y="0" width="604" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e74" value="질의" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b7280;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9ca3af;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v30" target="zq"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e75" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6b7280;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9ca3af;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.55;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v33" target="zq"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="v76" value="&lt;b&gt;예&lt;/b&gt; — demo 프로젝트: OrderService#findById ←COVERS— OrderServiceTest (실측) · OrderService#findById ←CALLS[high]— OrderController#get, OrderService#pay·cancel·updateAmount (추정) · OrderService#applyDiscount ←COVERS 없음 = '검증하는 테스트가 없다'가 바로 읽힌다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2b2b2b;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="700" width="1630" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="5. CLI Flows (Infographic)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="Code Test Agent — CLI Flows" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=26;fontColor=#2b2b2b;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="명령 하나 = 한 줄. 빨간 LLM 표시가 붙은 카드만 모델을 부른다. 생성물은 언제나 '제안'이고 apply를 쳐야 소스에 닿는다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#6b7280;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="row0" value="A · cta generate --class C  [--max-methods N] [--fast]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f1fb;strokeColor=#3b82c4;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#3b82c4;container=1;pointerEvents=0;opacity=70;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="1700" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff4dc;strokeColor=#d9932a;strokeWidth=2;container=1;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1" parent="row0"><mxGeometry x="30" y="42" width="180" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="" style="shape=image;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjZDk5MzJhIiBzdHJva